| `toolchain.node_major` | integer | `24` | a whole number, 1 or more | `scripts/check_toolchain.py`; `tests/integration/test_toolchain_gate.py` | Sets the Node major every frontend app's lockfile is resolved under: `make fe-install` exits 1 under another major before any `npm install`, and every workflow's setup-node installs it through the `toolchain` step's `node` output. Absent, the checker writes `[using default] toolchain.node_major = 24` to stderr; a value that is not a whole number of 1 or more is refused with exit 14. | the npm packages themselves: each app's committed `package-lock.json`, which `tests/integration/test_frontend_lockfile_gate.py` holds to its `package.json` | always |
